{"beat_id": "CH03_B12_L0001", "speaker_id": "torren", "text": "This is recent.", "left": {}, "right": {}, "active_side": "none", "advance_mode": "manual", "cues": {"pause_ms": 80, "interrupt": false, "implementation_flags": ["IN_WORLD_DIALOGUE"], "source_section": "[AUTHORED STOP — THIS WAS USED]", "source_speaker_label": "TORREN", "source_path": "docs/03_DIALOGUE/PRODUCTION/CHAPTER_03/BEAT_12_SEALWRIGHT_CHAMBER_COPYING_ATTEMPTS_DRAFT_A.md", "source_line": 21}},
{"beat_id": "CH03_B12_L0002", "speaker_id": "nimera", "text": "So are those. And those.", "left": {}, "right": {}, "active_side": "none", "advance_mode": "manual", "cues": {"pause_ms": 80, "interrupt": false, "implementation_flags": ["IN_WORLD_DIALOGUE"], "source_section": "[AUTHORED STOP — THIS WAS USED]", "source_speaker_label": "NIMERA", "source_path": "docs/03_DIALOGUE/PRODUCTION/CHAPTER_03/BEAT_12_SEALWRIGHT_CHAMBER_COPYING_ATTEMPTS_DRAFT_A.md", "source_line": 25}},
{"beat_id": "CH03_B12_L0003", "speaker_id": "nimera", "text": "There's a progression.", "left": {}, "right": {}, "active_side": "none", "advance_mode": "manual", "cues": {"pause_ms": 80, "interrupt": false, "implementation_flags": ["IN_WORLD_DIALOGUE"], "source_section": "[AUTHORED STOP — THIS WAS USED]", "source_speaker_label": "NIMERA", "source_path": "docs/03_DIALOGUE/PRODUCTION/CHAPTER_03/BEAT_12_SEALWRIGHT_CHAMBER_COPYING_ATTEMPTS_DRAFT_A.md", "source_line": 29}},
{"beat_id": "CH03_B12_L0004", "speaker_id": "cyanis", "text": "Somebody practiced here.", "left": {}, "right": {}, "active_side": "none", "advance_mode": "manual", "cues": {"pause_ms": 80, "interrupt": false, "implementation_flags": ["IN_WORLD_DIALOGUE"], "source_section": "[AUTHORED STOP — THIS WAS USED]", "source_speaker_label": "CYANIS", "source_path": "docs/03_DIALOGUE/PRODUCTION/CHAPTER_03/BEAT_12_SEALWRIGHT_CHAMBER_COPYING_ATTEMPTS_DRAFT_A.md", "source_line": 31}},
{"beat_id": "CH03_B12_L0005", "speaker_id": "nimera", "text": "Repeatedly. Early cuts wander. Later ones hold the line. Whoever did this improved in the room.", "left": {}, "right": {}, "active_side": "none", "advance_mode": "manual", "cues": {"pause_ms": 80, "interrupt": false, "implementation_flags": ["IN_WORLD_DIALOGUE"], "source_section": "[AUTHORED STOP — THIS WAS USED]", "source_speaker_label": "NIMERA", "source_path": "docs/03_DIALOGUE/PRODUCTION/CHAPTER_03/BEAT_12_SEALWRIGHT_CHAMBER_COPYING_ATTEMPTS_DRAFT_A.md", "source_line": 33}},
{"beat_id": "CH03_B12_L0006", "speaker_id": "ilyra", "text": "Which means time.", "left": {}, "right": {}, "active_side": "none", "advance_mode": "manual", "cues": {"pause_ms": 80, "interrupt": false, "implementation_flags": ["IN_WORLD_DIALOGUE"], "source_section": "[AUTHORED STOP — THIS WAS USED]", "source_speaker_label": "ILYRA", "source_path": "docs/03_DIALOGUE/PRODUCTION/CHAPTER_03/BEAT_12_SEALWRIGHT_CHAMBER_COPYING_ATTEMPTS_DRAFT_A.md", "source_line": 37}},
{"beat_id": "CH03_B12_L0007", "speaker_id": "nimera", "text": "Time, access, patience, supplies. Maybe instruction. That last one stays maybe.", "left": {}, "right": {}, "active_side": "none", "advance_mode": "manual", "cues": {"pause_ms": 80, "interrupt": false, "implementation_flags": ["IN_WORLD_DIALOGUE"], "source_section": "[AUTHORED STOP — THIS WAS USED]", "source_speaker_label": "NIMERA", "source_path": "docs/03_DIALOGUE/PRODUCTION/CHAPTER_03/BEAT_12_SEALWRIGHT_CHAMBER_COPYING_ATTEMPTS_DRAFT_A.md", "source_line": 39}},
{"beat_id": "CH03_B12_L0008", "speaker_id": "cyanis", "text": "That's ours.", "left": {}, "right": {}, "active_side": "none", "advance_mode": "manual", "cues": {"pause_ms": 80, "interrupt": false, "implementation_flags": ["IN_WORLD_DIALOGUE"], "source_section": "[AUTHORED STOP — THE CREST]", "source_speaker_label": "CYANIS", "source_path": "docs/03_DIALOGUE/PRODUCTION/CHAPTER_03/BEAT_12_SEALWRIGHT_CHAMBER_COPYING_ATTEMPTS_DRAFT_A.md", "source_line": 57}},
{"beat_id": "CH03_B12_L0009", "speaker_id": "nimera", "text": "Certain?", "left": {}, "right": {}, "active_side": "none", "advance_mode": "manual", "cues": {"pause_ms": 80, "interrupt": false, "implementation_flags": ["IN_WORLD_DIALOGUE"], "source_section": "[AUTHORED STOP — THE CREST]", "source_speaker_label": "NIMERA", "source_path": "docs/03_DIALOGUE/PRODUCTION/CHAPTER_03/BEAT_12_SEALWRIGHT_CHAMBER_COPYING_ATTEMPTS_DRAFT_A.md", "source_line": 61}},
{"beat_id": "CH03_B12_L0010", "speaker_id": "cyanis", "text": "Yes.", "left": {}, "right": {}, "active_side": "none", "advance_mode": "manual", "cues": {"pause_ms": 80, "interrupt": false, "implementation_flags": ["IN_WORLD_DIALOGUE"], "source_section": "[AUTHORED STOP — THE CREST]", "source_speaker_label": "CYANIS", "source_path": "docs/03_DIALOGUE/PRODUCTION/CHAPTER_03/BEAT_12_SEALWRIGHT_CHAMBER_COPYING_ATTEMPTS_DRAFT_A.md", "source_line": 63}},
{"beat_id": "CH03_B12_L0011", "speaker_id": "ilyra", "text": "How close?", "left": {}, "right": {}, "active_side": "none", "advance_mode": "manual", "cues": {"pause_ms": 80, "interrupt": false, "implementation_flags": ["IN_WORLD_DIALOGUE"], "source_section": "[AUTHORED STOP — THE CREST]", "source_speaker_label": "ILYRA", "source_path": "docs/03_DIALOGUE/PRODUCTION/CHAPTER_03/BEAT_12_SEALWRIGHT_CHAMBER_COPYING_ATTEMPTS_DRAFT_A.md", "source_line": 67}},
{"beat_id": "CH03_B12_L0012", "speaker_id": "cyanis", "text": "That could pass visually.", "left": {}, "right": {}, "active_side": "none", "advance_mode": "manual", "cues": {"pause_ms": 80, "interrupt": false, "implementation_flags": ["IN_WORLD_DIALOGUE"], "source_section": "[AUTHORED STOP — THE CREST]", "source_speaker_label": "CYANIS", "source_path": "docs/03_DIALOGUE/PRODUCTION/CHAPTER_03/BEAT_12_SEALWRIGHT_CHAMBER_COPYING_ATTEMPTS_DRAFT_A.md", "source_line": 71}},
{"beat_id": "CH03_B12_L0013", "speaker_id": "nimera", "text": "Visually. Important word.", "left": {}, "right": {}, "active_side": "none", "advance_mode": "manual", "cues": {"pause_ms": 80, "interrupt": false, "implementation_flags": ["IN_WORLD_DIALOGUE"], "source_section": "[AUTHORED STOP — THE CREST]", "source_speaker_label": "NIMERA", "source_path": "docs/03_DIALOGUE/PRODUCTION/CHAPTER_03/BEAT_12_SEALWRIGHT_CHAMBER_COPYING_ATTEMPTS_DRAFT_A.md", "source_line": 73}},
{"beat_id": "CH03_B12_L0014", "speaker_id": "torren", "text": "They kept pushing it.", "left": {}, "right": {}, "active_side": "none", "advance_mode": "manual", "cues": {"pause_ms": 80, "interrupt": false, "implementation_flags": ["IN_WORLD_DIALOGUE"], "source_section": "[AUTHORED STOP — THE CREST]", "source_speaker_label": "TORREN", "source_path": "docs/03_DIALOGUE/PRODUCTION/CHAPTER_03/BEAT_12_SEALWRIGHT_CHAMBER_COPYING_ATTEMPTS_DRAFT_A.md", "source_line": 77}},
{"beat_id": "CH03_B12_L0015", "speaker_id": "nimera", "text": "Hard enough to scorch a room built for this. Repeatedly.", "left": {}, "right": {}, "active_side": "none", "advance_mode": "manual", "cues": {"pause_ms": 80, "interrupt": false, "implementation_flags": ["IN_WORLD_DIALOGUE"], "source_section": "[AUTHORED STOP — THE CREST]", "source_speaker_label": "NIMERA", "source_path": "docs/03_DIALOGUE/PRODUCTION/CHAPTER_03/BEAT_12_SEALWRIGHT_CHAMBER_COPYING_ATTEMPTS_DRAFT_A.md", "source_line": 81}},
{"beat_id": "CH03_B12_L0016", "speaker_id": "ilyra", "text": "Did it ever work?", "left": {}, "right": {}, "active_side": "none", "advance_mode": "manual", "cues": {"pause_ms": 80, "interrupt": false, "implementation_flags": ["IN_WORLD_DIALOGUE"], "source_section": "[AUTHORED STOP — THE CREST]", "source_speaker_label": "ILYRA", "source_path": "docs/03_DIALOGUE/PRODUCTION/CHAPTER_03/BEAT_12_SEALWRIGHT_CHAMBER_COPYING_ATTEMPTS_DRAFT_A.md", "source_line": 83}},
{"beat_id": "CH03_B12_L0017", "speaker_id": "nimera", "text": "I can prove they reproduced the mark. I can prove they tried to make it do more than look correct. I can prove repeated magical load.", "left": {}, "right": {}, "active_side": "none", "advance_mode": "manual", "cues": {"pause_ms": 80, "interrupt": false, "implementation_flags": ["IN_WORLD_DIALOGUE"], "source_section": "[AUTHORED STOP — THE CREST]", "source_speaker_label": "NIMERA", "source_path": "docs/03_DIALOGUE/PRODUCTION/CHAPTER_03/BEAT_12_SEALWRIGHT_CHAMBER_COPYING_ATTEMPTS_DRAFT_A.md", "source_line": 87}},
{"beat_id": "CH03_B12_L0018", "speaker_id": "nimera", "text": "I cannot prove they produced the Queen's authority response.", "left": {}, "right": {}, "active_side": "none", "advance_mode": "manual", "cues": {"pause_ms": 80, "interrupt": false, "implementation_flags": ["IN_WORLD_DIALOGUE"], "source_section": "[AUTHORED STOP — THE CREST]", "source_speaker_label": "NIMERA", "source_path": "docs/03_DIALOGUE/PRODUCTION/CHAPTER_03/BEAT_12_SEALWRIGHT_CHAMBER_COPYING_ATTEMPTS_DRAFT_A.md", "source_line": 91}},
{"beat_id": "CH03_B12_L0019", "speaker_id": "cyanis", "text": "Could they have?", "left": {}, "right": {}, "active_side": "none", "advance_mode": "manual", "cues": {"pause_ms": 80, "interrupt": false, "implementation_flags": ["IN_WORLD_DIALOGUE"], "source_section": "[AUTHORED STOP — THE CREST]", "source_speaker_label": "CYANIS", "source_path": "docs/03_DIALOGUE/PRODUCTION/CHAPTER_03/BEAT_12_SEALWRIGHT_CHAMBER_COPYING_ATTEMPTS_DRAFT_A.md", "source_line": 95}},
{"beat_id": "CH03_B12_L0020", "speaker_id": "nimera", "text": "I can't rule it out.", "left": {}, "right": {}, "active_side": "none", "advance_mode": "manual", "cues": {"pause_ms": 80, "interrupt": false, "implementation_flags": ["IN_WORLD_DIALOGUE"], "source_section": "[AUTHORED STOP — THE CREST]", "source_speaker_label": "NIMERA", "source_path": "docs/03_DIALOGUE/PRODUCTION/CHAPTER_03/BEAT_12_SEALWRIGHT_CHAMBER_COPYING_ATTEMPTS_DRAFT_A.md", "source_line": 97}},
{"beat_id": "CH03_B12_L0021", "speaker_id": "nimera", "text": "That is not the same sentence as `they did`.", "left": {}, "right": {}, "active_side": "none", "advance_mode": "manual", "cues": {"pause_ms": 80, "interrupt": false, "implementation_flags": ["IN_WORLD_DIALOGUE"], "source_section": "[AUTHORED STOP — THE CREST]", "source_speaker_label": "NIMERA", "source_path": "docs/03_DIALOGUE/PRODUCTION/CHAPTER_03/BEAT_12_SEALWRIGHT_CHAMBER_COPYING_ATTEMPTS_DRAFT_A.md", "source_line": 101}},
{"beat_id": "CH03_B12_L0022", "speaker_id": "torren", "text": "Understood.", "left": {}, "right": {}, "active_side": "none", "advance_mode": "manual", "cues": {"pause_ms": 80, "interrupt": false, "implementation_flags": ["IN_WORLD_DIALOGUE"], "source_section": "[AUTHORED STOP — THE CREST]", "source_speaker_label": "TORREN", "source_path": "docs/03_DIALOGUE/PRODUCTION/CHAPTER_03/BEAT_12_SEALWRIGHT_CHAMBER_COPYING_ATTEMPTS_DRAFT_A.md", "source_line": 103}},
{"beat_id": "CH03_B12_L0023", "speaker_id": "nimera", "text": "Good.", "left": {}, "right": {}, "active_side": "none", "advance_mode": "manual", "cues": {"pause_ms": 80, "interrupt": false, "implementation_flags": ["IN_WORLD_DIALOGUE"], "source_section": "[AUTHORED STOP — THE CREST]", "source_speaker_label": "NIMERA", "source_path": "docs/03_DIALOGUE/PRODUCTION/CHAPTER_03/BEAT_12_SEALWRIGHT_CHAMBER_COPYING_ATTEMPTS_DRAFT_A.md", "source_line": 105}},
{"beat_id": "CH03_B12_L0024", "speaker_id": "torren", "text": "Same work keeps getting narrower.", "left": {}, "right": {}, "active_side": "none", "advance_mode": "manual", "cues": {"pause_ms": 80, "interrupt": false, "implementation_flags": ["IN_WORLD_DIALOGUE"], "source_section": "[THE WORKING TRAIL]", "source_speaker_label": "TORREN", "source_path": "docs/03_DIALOGUE/PRODUCTION/CHAPTER_03/BEAT_12_SEALWRIGHT_CHAMBER_COPYING_ATTEMPTS_DRAFT_A.md", "source_line": 111}},
{"beat_id": "CH03_B12_L0025", "speaker_id": "nimera", "text": "Ancient forms first. Then older Yahtrean. Then royal examples. Then the current Crest.", "left": {}, "right": {}, "active_side": "none", "advance_mode": "manual", "cues": {"pause_ms": 80, "interrupt": false, "implementation_flags": ["IN_WORLD_DIALOGUE"], "source_section": "[THE WORKING TRAIL]", "source_speaker_label": "NIMERA", "source_path": "docs/03_DIALOGUE/PRODUCTION/CHAPTER_03/BEAT_12_SEALWRIGHT_CHAMBER_COPYING_ATTEMPTS_DRAFT_A.md", "source_line": 115}},
